      "message": "fix(ui): stock page shows stock only; theme gets its own ribbon button\n\nThe Stock page drew the Machine, Post and Theme sections under the\nstock controls, though Machine and Post have their own setup nodes\nsince #343/#390 and the theme is document-wide. The page now ends at\nits action row; Machine and Post stay editable on their setup nodes.\n\nThe theme moved to a new \"Theme…\" ribbon door right of Panels (View\ngroup). Its dropdown (theme_drop.rs, the View/machine door popup law)\nlists Dark, Light, the discovered assets/themes/*.json files by name\nand Browse..., then the colour-vision modes that rode inside the old\ntheme section. Picks queue SelectTheme / SelectThemeDialog /\nSelectColorVision, so undo and redo hold. The unused colour-vision\ncombo is removed. Shell snapshots regenerated: only the ribbon moved.\n\nFixes #441\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
